Firefox is Mozilla's full web browser, with modern JavaScript, video and WebAssembly.
This port installs it as a ready-made set of files together with the GTK3 and media
libraries it needs, so nothing else has to be built. It runs natively on wayland
(the firefox launcher in /usr/local/bin sets MOZ_ENABLE_WAYLAND=1) and uses software
rendering until GPU drivers are available. The files go in /usr and /etc, and removing
the port deletes only the files it created.
upstream: https://www.mozilla.org/firefox/
